# The source the package is built from: qemu-rdp in Marc-André Lureau's qemu-display project (MIT),
# an RDP server (IronRDP) for QEMU's D-Bus display. Read by build.sh and version.sh (plain KEY=value
# lines, no shell beyond that).
#
# The pin is the last commit whose qemu-rdp takes all its crates from crates.io (ironrdp 0.15): the
# next one (e9f0730, 2026-08-24, USB redirection) takes IronRDP and usbredir-proto from git
# repositories, which build.sh's `cargo vendor` doesn't fetch. QEMU_RDP_VERSION is qemu-rdp's own
# version at the pin (qemu-rdp/Cargo.toml; build.sh checks it).
#
# To bump: set the commit, its committer date (YYYYMMDD) and qemu-rdp's version, check that the
# patches still apply and that qemu-rdp/Cargo.toml names no git dependency, then `make wsh-qemu-rdp`
# (build.sh fails on a git source in the vendored lock file). A bump is a commit to this file, so the
# package's version (version.sh) goes up with it.
QEMU_DISPLAY_URL=https://gitlab.com/marcandre.lureau/qemu-display.git
QEMU_DISPLAY_COMMIT=8ac3da95abeca92e5bb0aee2c58adf54e86f4482
QEMU_DISPLAY_DATE=20260604
QEMU_RDP_VERSION=0.1.1
